### TypeScript / Node.js (ElizaOS / AgentKit):
```typescript
import { OpticParseClient } from 'opticparse';

const client = new OpticParseClient({
  apiKey: process.env.OPTICPARSE_API_KEY || 'op_live_trial_200'
